}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe957ef4-bf6c-4eb4-9f29-a3ffb82ca5fb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"checkout曖昧な動作するのがヤバいと常々思ってる","ts":"1637823157.155000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lfN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e3a3e0a-8d37-4a86-9e81-355c8efbacef","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"同じ名前のファイルとブランチがあるときに警告が出つつブランチが優先されるみたいなのがあった気がする","ts":"1637823093.153500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WQ6G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60955e30-724e-494e-8e80-ebeca943fe97","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"checkoutでファイルを操作するのって `git checkout {branch} -- {file}` のショートハンドですよね、コンフリクト解消のためにたまに使う","ts":"1637822983.151900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DjP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fbf8d86-dfca-4ade-b32e-b03cedc1975b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"こういうやつ \u003chttps://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/NILFS|https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/NILFS\u003e","ts":"1637822983.151800","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: NILFS","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"NILFS","title_link":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/NILFS","text":"NILFS（New Implementation of a Log-structured File System）またはNILFS2は Linux 向けのログ構造化ファイルシステム（バージョニングファイルシステム）である。NILFS は NTTサイバースペース研究所（日本電信電話の一部門）によって開発され、GNU General Public License (GPL) のもとでリリースされている。\nLinuxカーネル2.6.30にて、同じく日本発のTOMOYO Linuxと共にメインラインにマージされた。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/NILFS","original_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/NILFS"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uZl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a64a869-8163-4e45-a10a-e638cc12586e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ファイルシステムが勝手にバックアップしてくれるとかだといいんですけどね","ts":"1637822976.151300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qaL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb5b951f-d915-40ab-8367-437236ee4505","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"最初はstash \u0026gt; stash popを定期的にやればいいかと思ってたんですけど、それをやるとwatchしてるビルドとかが大量に走って死亡しました","ts":"1637822850.149700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/UVwN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e56c608-83a3-441f-8150-347c7e85be66","type":"message","user":"U01NKCTP7B4","text":"\u0026gt; 自分は一定時間で自動でreflog残すようにしてるけどそこではstash使えないんですよね、ファイルシステムに副作用が起きるので\nなんかテクいですね\nreflog に残るなら戻せるので何やっても良さそうですね.","ts":"1637822795.148900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FhDw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"002646a5-5eed-4329-aac2-4e7e0040aad9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"checkout path/to/file","ts":"1637822681.148000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SHuH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c612bff-a5e4-40e7-91c1-8d4cf8b6f0e4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`checkout .` というかファイルやディレクトリ単位で吹っ飛ばしたいことがちょくちょくあるからそれで使う気がする","ts":"1637822673.147800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DK7P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95f6b2e6-3266-4351-a533-bab04bd61e5f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分は一定時間で自動でreflog残すようにしてるけどそこではstash使えないんですよね、ファイルシステムに副作用が起きるので","ts":"1637822537.147100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1jr1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ae3a8e8-e766-493d-9693-6b16a6fefacd","type":"message","user":"U01NKCTP7B4","text":"あ、入らないですね、 いてれ来るのは `-a` か","ts":"1637822513.146600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IFNe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bcd0cff1-fcfa-449a-97e9-89bbe238162d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ん、多分入らないと思うけどどうだろう","ts":"1637822457.145700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zep0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f174a7d9-1a51-4ddf-bc2d-11f1d2dc3f0d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"残りますね","ts":"1637822440.145400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oVlC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e755fbd-584d-4e54-9b4b-c0b3583f68f9","type":"message","user":"U01NKCTP7B4","text":"~`-u` `node_modules` とか入れてきません? `.gitignore`  無視して :tsurai_orange:~","ts":"1637822436.145300","edited":{"user":"U01NKCTP7B4","ts":"1637822672.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zJqC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d648ce6-8acb-40fd-a658-adb81ccd3c0d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"reflogに残る(残りますよね？)し","ts":"1637822424.145000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lwo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad379cd2-4562-4460-942d-18c467db6462","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"stashした物を消すというのは確かにありだな","ts":"1637822394.143800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T1W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4af28a0-8a20-42f3-874d-be1484408308","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`stash -u` かなぁ","ts":"1637822380.143200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1=a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0942405-cbf9-44bc-8de6-0d28153a3bb4","type":"message","user":"U01NKCTP7B4","text":"`stash` が安全","ts":"1637822340.143000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DgO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d957aa3a-cb8a-48b0-9c1c-06fad6c0a30e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`checkout .` 多用するけど危険","ts":"1637822301.142700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mmtvZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f342d6d1-8ab9-4f5d-b417-d0f5a5f61b29","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"reset --hardだと、unstageだけじゃないところも動くからなあ....(うっかり違うコミットに移動しちゃう、のはまああ指定しないとないか)","ts":"1637819466.142200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1kY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85172219-a46b-43ce-b90b-e43101f57ec1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; Unstaging な変更を戻す（git add をする前）\n\u0026gt; $ git checkout .\n\u0026gt; $ git restore .\n\u003chttps://kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/04/08/151627\u003e\n`git reset --hard` 派だなぁ。 `git checkout .` 知らなかった","ts":"1637818263.141300","attachments":[{"fallback":"kakakakakku blog: git checkout の代替としてリリースされた git switch と git restore - kakakakakku blog","id":1,"title":"git checkout の代替としてリリースされた git switch と git restore - kakakakakku blog","title_link":"https://kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/04/08/151627","text":"2019年8月にリリースされた Git 2.23 から，Experimental（実験的機能）として新コマンド git switch と git restore が使える．今までずっと使ってきた git checkout は機能が多すぎたため，機能を分割し git checkout の代替としてリリースされた．個人的にリリースされてから，できる限り git switch と git restore を使うようにしてるけど，まだ無意識に git checkout を使ってしまうこともある．最近 git switch を教える機会があったため，ブログにまとめておく． \u003chttp://github.blog|github.blog\u003e なお，…","image_url":"https://cdn.blog.st-hatena.com/images/theme/og-image-1500.png","blocks":null,"ts":1586326587,"service_name":"kakakakakku blog","service_icon":"https://kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/04/08/151627","original_url":"https://kakakakakku.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/04/08/151627"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DmWRq"}]}]
